Subject: Verify direct ONNX downloads and cache hits before inference

Freecut MIT adaptation for FL-111. Reuse the existing owner-bound byte
verifier for direct ONNX weights, vocabulary and configuration. Reject and
evict corrupt or no-longer-matching cache entries; never persist unverified
network bytes. Text and JSON use the same verified download path. This adds
no model approvals and does not qualify any model, browser or workload.

